SysVR4 and (hence?) Solaris 2 have /bin a symlink to /usr/bin. The
static binaries are in /sbin (although there are also a couple of
dynamic binaries in there as well). Unfortunately, /usr/sbin contains
almost only dynamic binaries. Oh well...

I'm not saying I agree with SysVR4, BTW :-)

